  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative focus on a unified audit trail and the emphasis on sustainability. However, I must reiterate that the requirement for processing transactions within 2 seconds (EFF-01) is non-negotiable for user experience. I propose that we explore advanced logging mechanisms for the unified audit trail that minimize latency while ensuring security and compliance. Additionally, let's ensure that any energy-efficient designs for logging do not compromise the speed and efficiency of transaction processing. I support the idea of advanced encryption technologies, provided they align with the performance goals of the system.",
